            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-20",
                    "linecount": 30,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 537.0, 0.5, 365.0, 420.0 ],
                    "text": "Args: name (a.k.a. context)\n          (optional) custom output cell abstraction (see D4~)\n\nInlets (from left to right): signal, x, y, gain (default 1.0), up ramp between values (default 10ms), and down ramp between values (default 10ms), other options (radius, mask, info, med, auth), and speaker setup options (setup, layer, solo, end).\n\nOther options:\nradius -- specifies source radius in degrees (1-360, default 1)\ninfo -- outputs D4 channel info to the console\nauth -- try to (re)authorize D4\nmask -- specifies mask for specific channel, e.g. mask 5 0.5 will make mask 0.5 on the output channel 5 (default 1.0 for all channels); commonly used by the mask editor\nmed -- outputs mask editor and visualizer info; commonly used by the mask editor and visualizer\nrefresh -- outputs all parameters including ones that haven't changed (used internally after the speaker configuration has been updated)\n\nSpeaker setup options:\nsetup -- lists layers from -90 to 90 degrees\nlayer -- specifies layer number, followed by speaker channel and azimuth pairs ordered from 0 to 360 degrees clockwise\nsolo -- specifies independent layer using same syntax like layer, except layers do not have elevation\nend -- used to inform D4 that the setup list is complete\n\nThe default setup is for the 130-channel Cube array (124.4.2)."
                }
            },
